    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορδύλη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span>, cf. Lat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cordȳla</i>, <i><span class="en">
