				3.2.4
			</span></i>, al.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορδύλα</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				485.39
			</span></i>], ἡ, <i>club, cudgel</i>, <i><span class="en">
